# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# The package description for tools/package.py (NBTFoundry/manager): one argument
# per line. `make package` and the release workflow both use it; they add the
# version, sequence, key, output and executable. Bridge 1.7: the payload is the
# guest, run by NBT Manager's nbt-runner (runner); the romsets, zipped as
# FinalBurn Neo reads them, and their BIOS sets come through `files` (a .zip is
# stored whole: the core reads the archive). Large sets come from a USB stick:
# the phone sends at most 64 MiB.
--app
fbneo
--compat
nbt_6.5_armv7
--bridge
1.7
--bridge-uses
show,controller,files,runner
--bridge-optional
status,live-settings,gamepad
--bridge-files
zip,7z|512|16384
--setting
aspect|Aspect|4-3|4-3,pixel,full
--setting
filter|Filter|sharp|sharp,smooth,nearest
--setting
neogeo|Neo Geo|auto|auto,mvs,aes,unibios
--setting
cpu_speed|CPU clock|100|80,90,100,110,120
--setting
frameskip|Frame skip|off|off,auto,1,2
--setting
sound|Sound|on|on,off
--setting
show_fps|Show FPS|off|off,on
--setting
debug_log|Debug log|off|off,on
# What the phone app shows before an install (NBT Manager's PROTOCOL.md,
# "Package information"): the FinalBurn Neo version the pin builds
# (tools/package_version.py: `make package-args`; `make test` checks it), the
# project, the licence and the notices.
--property
FinalBurn Neo|1.0.0.03 (2cfc5f3)
--property
Project|FinalBurn Neo (https://github.com/libretro/FBNeo)
--property
Licence|FinalBurn Neo licence (non-commercial)
--text
Arcade games by FinalBurn Neo, with NBTFoundry's changes for NBT Manager.
--text=
--text
FinalBurn Neo may be shared only free of charge: no sale, no monetary gain, no donations (its licence and MAME's).
--text
No game, ROM or BIOS is included.
--text=
--text
Source, licences and notices: https://github.com/NBTFoundry/nf-fbneo
